<title>USA: America West extends stock buyback program.</title>
<headline>America West extends stock buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>America West Holdings Corp said Monday its board of directors extended it's existing stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>The program authorizes the purchase of up to 2.5 million shares of the company's class B common stock and all of the company's publicly traded warrants, in private or open market transaction as circumstances warrant. The stock repurchase plan was extended through December 31, 1999.</p>
</text>
